00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:16.050
<b>"  Comparative Experiment 1</b>

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:16.050
<b>Kanade and Himuro Shall Make Close Contact   "</b>

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.930
I'm sorry, Yukimura-kun.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.420
I never thought that things 
would turn out this way.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:26.120
Wait, Himuro...

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:27.790
It can't be true...

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:31.020
When you touched me...

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.370
When you held me...

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:34.340
I was so very happy.

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:37.810
And it was because you were special to me.

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:40.280
That's what I felt.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.500
But I...

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:43.820
I was wrong!

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:46.830
Because... Because I...

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:50.570
feel so happy hugging Kanade-chan, too!

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:52.530
She's so adorable!

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:55.580
It's impossible not to be happy! 
Totally impossible!

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.840
Stop! Himuro!

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.480
What's going on here?!

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:06.780
Kanade-chan, things with Yukimura-kun 
still aren't settled, but I...

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.980
Kanade-chan, I think I love you.

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:13.340
Please stop saying things that will 
destroy the essence of the premise!

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.110
It's only a nuisance for you, isn't it?

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:18.620
I never said it was a nuisance!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.860
Kanade-chan...

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:25.520
But for oxytocin to be 
produced between two females

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:28.810
might be an issue for the 
romance experiments...

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:31.560
Come now. What's wrong with it?

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:33.240
Fujiwara-san?

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:39.000
We women love adorable things,
 and soft things.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:43.510
<b>Ham-chan</b>

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:43.510
<b>Ino-chan</b>

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:43.510
<b>Older
brother</b>

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:43.510
<b>Princess</b>

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:43.510
<b>Nice
neighbor girl</b>

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:43.510
<b>Tamako-chan</b>

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:43.500
When we're children, we love all kinds of 
things in a very straight-forward manner.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:43.500
Love, love, love...

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:48.890
But when we become adults, ridiculous, commonly held ideas get in the way.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:51.510
Don't love other women.

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:53.640
Don't love your teachers.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:53.130
<i>So soft...</i>

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:54.610
That's what they say.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:57.890
Don't you think all that is just stupid?

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:57.890
<i>She smells so nice...</i>

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:01.030
You should love what you love.

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:04.520
Now, be honest with yourself, won't you?

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:06.830
Hey! Stop that woman!

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.500
She's your girlfriend, isn't she?!

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:12.150
I can't! Once Sui gets like 
that, she's invincible!

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:12.830
Yo!

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:14.660
<b>"  Comparative Experiment 2</b>

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.660
<b>Himuro and Chris Shall Make Close Contact  "</b>

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:18.460
I can't do it!

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.930
It may be for an experiment,

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:23.590
but the thought of touching the skin 
of a woman other than Sui is just...

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:27.460
As a knight, as a man... I cannot do it!

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:28.620
Yo!

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.430
<b>"   Comparative Experiment 3</b>

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.430
<b>Yukimura and Fujiwara Shall Make Close Contact"</b>

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:34.320
W-Wait! You're too close!

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:37.730
It's fine, Yukimura-han.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.440
It's for an experiment.

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:42.060
Y-Your chest is...

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:46.070
Human bodies are so warm.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.840
Sui!

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.360
It's because you're always 
doing stuff like this...!

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:52.960
Kyaaa! Chris, you're so scary!

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:56.050
<i>Fujiwara-san does that 
on purpose, doesn't she?</i>

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:58.090
<i>She's a scary woman.</i>

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.700
Why do you look so displeased?

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:02.860
No reason.

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:07.600
Our oxytocin levels are already 
in a perilous state, and yet...

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:12.250
you seem to be ogling 
Fujiwara-san quite a bit.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:17.210
I was just thinking that I'm looking forward 
to tomorrow's test results, that's all.

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:21.120
You're the one who looked 
so very happy with Kanade!

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:23.010
It doesn't count between women!

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:24.760
Ibarada-senpai said the same thing!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.600
That's sexual discrimination! 
It lacks impartiality!

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:32.040
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:35.250
<i>I don't feel like I'm producing 
any happiness hormones at all.</i>

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:38.150
And I made Himuro angry.

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:43.600
Forget producing more 
oxytocin than yesterday,

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:47.650
making her angry by staring 
at Suiu's beauty is just...

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.890
You're quite the backstabber, Yukimura-kun.

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:56.280
In large part, it's your girlfriend's fault.

00:06:57.230 --> 00:07:01.000
Besides which, our love for each 
other hasn't been determined yet.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.800
And it isn't as though we're dating.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:06.320
No one has any right to 
say I've betrayed her.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:12.690
You little— What are you doing?!

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:16.140
Yukimura-kun, I'm disappointed in you.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.970
A woman as lovely as her has turned 
her affections toward you,

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:23.260
but you can't even express 
your own feelings clearly.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:27.090
You lay the blame on the fact that 
the definition of "love" is unknown.

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:28.700
And in doing that...

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:31.080
you have caused her great sadness 
up to this point, haven't you?

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:38.320
On top of all that, this is all 
the oxytocin you can produce?

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:42.280
As a knight, as a man, you are a failure.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.850
I find it unforgivable.

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:47.460
No...

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:48.520
You're wrong!

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:55.230
We began this romance research 
with my full approval, as well.

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:58.210
My own emotions are undetermined.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:01.490
And he would never make light of that.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:05.250
Please do not speak ill of him when 
you know nothing of the situation.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.110
That's right, Chris.

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:12.030
There's no need to speak so harshly.

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:14.910
Yes. I've gone a little 
too far with my words.

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:16.270
My apologies.

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:18.670
I just find it unforgivable.

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:21.140
Any actions that go against 
the code of chivalry...

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:24.520
In spite of the fact that she had 
been hostile shortly before,

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.160
Himuro-kun protected him 
with everything she had.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.780
A woman of tremendously high integrity.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:35.910
Do you possess the ability to respond 
to the feelings of a woman like her?

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.550
Return tomorrow.

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:42.660
We'll have the results 
of today's experiments.

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:49.900
We won't know until the experiment's 
results come out tomorrow!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.590
Let's just wait until then!

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:55.130
Yes. Let's go home for the day.

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:00.340
Yukimura-kun...

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:11.440
<i>It's impossible.</i>

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:14.280
<i>Our oxytocin will never beat them.</i>

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.880
<i>There's too great a gap 
between us and that couple.</i>

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:22.180
If you determine that what you 
feel for each other isn't love,

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:25.140
will you simply say, 
"Oh, I see!" and walk away?

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.020
<i>Numbers are absolute.</i>

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.130
<i>We were no match for those two.</i>

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:34.420
<i>We are not deserving of love.</i>

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.800
That shouldn't be possible! It's stupid!

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.810
<i>Think.</i>

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.320
<i>Don't interpret the experiment's 
results in a simplistic manner.</i>

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:51.160
<i>There must be something.</i>

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:52.340
<i>Think!</i>

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:58.520
It seems Yukimura-kun will be a little late.

00:09:58.880 --> 00:09:59.930
I see.

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:02.970
These are the results of the experiment.

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:08.320
<i>As expected, the oxytocin levels 
between me and Yukimura-kun are low.</i>

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:08.920
Himuro

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:08.920
Yukimura

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:13.340
